1.1 ARCHITECTURE PARADIGM
───────────────────────────
  Model: 100% Serverless (no persistent backend server)
  Runtime: Next.js API Routes (App Router) — deployed on Vercel Edge/Node runtime
  Data persistence: Google Docs (log) + Google Calendar (availability)
  No database: No PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, or Supabase
  All state lives in: Google Docs, Google Calendar, and runtime memory

  Why serverless?
  - Zero infrastructure maintenance for a single admin
  - Cost: Pay per request (near-zero for a grooming studio volume)
  - Deployments via Vercel CI/CD without server management
  - Scales automatically for traffic spikes

