1.3 REQUEST FLOW DIAGRAM
──────────────────────────
  1. User or Jude initiates booking
  2. Frontend calls /api/availability → reads Google Calendar
  3. Available slots returned → user selects
  4. Frontend calls /api/booking/initiate → validates inputs, assigns staff
  5. System calls /api/payment/create-link → Paystack generates link
  6. Link emailed to user via /api/notify/email
  7. User pays → provides transaction reference
  8. Frontend calls /api/payment/verify → checks Paystack API
  9. /api/payment/verify also checks Google Docs for duplicate reference
  10. If clean: calls /api/booking/confirm
  11. /api/booking/confirm → writes to Google Docs + creates Google Calendar event
  12. Triggers /api/notify/staff (WhatsApp) + /api/notify/client (email/WhatsApp)
  13. Returns confirmation to frontend

