ROUTE GROUP: /api/payment
────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  POST /api/payment/create-link
  ──────────────────────────────
  Purpose: Generate a Paystack payment link for the deposit
  Body: { bookingId: string, email: string, amount: number }
  Auth: Internal

  Logic:
    1. Call Paystack Initialize Transaction API
       - Endpoint: POST https://api.paystack.co/transaction/initialize
       - Headers: Authorization: Bearer PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY
       - Body: { email, amount (in kobo = GHS × 100), currency: "GHS",
                 reference: bookingId, metadata: { bookingId } }
    2. Return payment link from Paystack response
    3. Trigger email to client with link

  Response 200:
    {
      paymentUrl: string,    // Paystack checkout URL
      reference: string
    }

  ─────────────────────────────────────
  POST /api/payment/verify
  ─────────────────────────────────────
  Purpose: Dual-verify a Paystack transaction reference
  Body: { reference: string, bookingId: string }

  Logic — DUAL VERIFICATION:
    STEP A — Paystack API Check:
      1. Call GET https://api.paystack.co/transaction/verify/{reference}
      2. Check response.data.status === "success"
      3. Check response.data.amount matches expected deposit (with tolerance)
      4. Check response.data.currency === "GHS"

    STEP B — Google Docs Duplicate Check:
      1. Read all transaction references from Google Docs payment log
      2. Check if this reference already exists
      3. If already used → return DUPLICATE error

    STEP C — Confirmation:
      1. If both checks pass → call /api/booking/confirm internally
      2. Append reference to Google Docs used-references list
      3. Return confirmed booking details

  Response 200 (success):
    {
      verified: true,
      bookingId: string,
      booking: { ... }
    }

  Response 400 (failed):
    { verified: false, reason: "PAYMENT_FAILED" | "DUPLICATE_REF" | "AMOUNT_MISMATCH" }

  ─────────────────────────────────────
  GET /api/payment/status
  ─────────────────────────────────────
  Purpose: Check payment status for a bookingId (admin use)
  Query: { bookingId: string }
  Returns: { status: "paid" | "pending" | "failed", reference?: string }

