  ─────────────────────────────────────
  POST /api/notify/reminders (CRON)
  ─────────────────────────────────────
  Purpose: Scheduled job to send appointment reminders
  Trigger: Vercel Cron Job, runs every 30 minutes

  Logic:
    1. Query Google Calendar for events in next 1 hour and 30 minutes
    2. For each event found:
       - Extract client data from event description
       - Determine reminder method (email or WhatsApp)
       - Check if reminder already sent (Google Doc flag)
       - If not sent: dispatch notification + mark as sent

  Config (vercel.json):
    {
      "crons": [
        { "path": "/api/notify/reminders", "schedule": "*/30 * * * *" }
      ]
    }

