ROUTE GROUP: /api/jude (Vapi Webhooks)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  POST /api/jude/webhook
  ──────────────────────
  Purpose: Handle inbound events from Vapi (Jude's voice AI platform)
  This is Jude's "tool call" endpoint — Jude calls this to take actions.

  Incoming event types:
    function_call: Jude wants to execute a function
    end_of_call_report: Call ended, log summary
    transcript: Full call transcript
    status_update: Call state changes

  Function calls Jude can make:
    check_availability(date, service) → calls /api/availability internally
    initiate_booking(payload)         → calls /api/booking/initiate
    send_payment_link(bookingId)      → calls /api/payment/create-link
    verify_payment(reference, bookingId) → calls /api/payment/verify
    log_complaint(clientName, summary) → appends to complaint doc
    get_services()                    → returns services + prices from config
    get_faq(question)                 → returns static FAQ answer
    add_to_waitlist(payload)          → calls /api/booking/waitlist

  Response to Vapi function calls:
    { result: <string or JSON stringified data> }

  POST /api/jude/complaint
  ──────────────────────────
  Purpose: Direct complaint logging endpoint
  Body: { clientName, clientPhone, summary, callId? }
  Effect: Append to Google Docs complaint log + WhatsApp notify admin

