    - Jude webhook: HMAC signature validation using VAPI_WEBHOOK_SECRET
    - Payment webhook (if used): Paystack HMAC-SHA512 signature check
    - All secrets: server-side env variables only (never NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefixed)

  6.2 Rate limiting:
    - /api/booking/initiate: 5 requests per IP per 10 minutes
    - /api/payment/verify: 10 requests per IP per 5 minutes
    - /api/notify/*: No client-facing rate limit (internal only)
    - Implementation: Upstash Redis + @upstash/ratelimit (or edge-level Vercel)

  6.3 Input validation:
    - All API inputs validated with Zod schemas before processing
    - Phone numbers: Ghana format regex validation
    - Email: Standard email validation
    - Date/time: Must be future dates within next 60 days
    - Service IDs: Must be in allowed enum

  6.4 Idempotency:
    - Booking initiation: bookingId as idempotency key
    - Payment verification: Reference already-used check in Google Docs

  6.5 CORS:
    - Allow only: groomstudio.com, localhost (dev)
    - Jude webhook: Allow Vapi IP ranges

